flowchart TD
    START([Alert]) --> intake[Alert Intake Agent]
    intake --> logs[Log Analyzer Agent]
    logs --> commits[Commit Correlator Agent]
    commits --> rag[Grounded Diagnosis / Chroma RAG]
    rag --> patch[Patch Writer + Sandbox Tests]
    patch --> critic[Safety Critic / Risk Score]
    critic --> router{Deterministic Router}
    router -->|confidence >= 0.75, tests green, no flags| deploy[Deploy to Isolated Sandbox]
    router -->|otherwise| escalate[Escalate to On-call]
    deploy --> report[Reporter / Slack]
    escalate --> report
    report --> trace[Local JSON + Optional Langfuse]
